      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick question. i'm on haloperidol for my schizophrenia but ive been dealing with this awful sinus pressure and congestion all day. is it okay if i take some sudafed (pseudoephedrine) to help clear it up? just want to breathe normally for a bit.",
